WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:12.600
Safety rules: rules that recognise sensitive messages (emergencies, medical, legal, financial, under-18s) and set how the assistant behaves with them.

2
00:00:13.151 --> 00:00:20.690
Open each set in "Rule sets" and see its behaviour: a safe reply, a handoff to the team, or an alert.

3
00:00:21.243 --> 00:00:26.300
Check your country's emergency numbers; these are what emergency replies send.

4
00:00:26.854 --> 00:00:32.570
Type a sentence in "Test a message" and click "Review" to see which rule catches it.

5
00:00:33.118 --> 00:00:38.600
For cases specific to your trade, create a "New rule" under "Your rules".

6
00:00:39.147 --> 00:00:45.720
Don't turn off the default rules unless you're sure; they stop medical advice and wrong promises.
